<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3327845553"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1855824540"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="命をくれよ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="トゲナシトゲアリ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="全部をさらして生きてやる"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:20.527"><div begin="00:10.013" end="02:59.358"><p begin="00:10.013" end="00:14.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">空が泣いてくれるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为天空正在为我哭泣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra ga na i te ku re ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:15.114" end="00:19.594" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">私は大丈夫だよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我并不要紧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha da i jo u bu da yo</span></p><p begin="00:20.221" end="00:27.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">どんなに身体や心が抉られようと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论身心将会遭受到怎样的摧残</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na ni ka ra da ya ko ko ro ga e gu ra re yo u to</span></p><p begin="00:27.819" end="00:33.034" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">私は大丈夫だよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都觉得不要紧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha da i jo u bu da yo</span></p><p begin="00:35.374" end="00:39.868" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">随分歩いてきた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一路辗转跋涉后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu i bu n a ru i te ki ta</span></p><p begin="00:40.428" end="00:44.854" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">無音が鳴る此処まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抵达寂静无声的此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu o n ga na ru ko ko ma de</span></p><p begin="00:45.463" end="00:49.513" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">この公園だけは変わらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有这座公园并未改变过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ko u e n da ke ha ka wa ra na i</span></p><p begin="00:49.749" end="00:54.871" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">私だけの居場所なんだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是只属于我的容身之处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi da ke no i ba sho na n da yo</span></p><p begin="00:54.899" end="01:02.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">肩に伝わる雨の鼓動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肩头传来落雨的悸动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ta ni tsu ta wa ru a me no ko do u</span></p><p begin="01:02.528" end="01:07.388" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">強くなれない 正しくなれない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以变得强大 难以正确处事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ku na re na i ta da shi ku na re na i</span></p><p begin="01:07.581" end="01:12.045" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">なんでこんなに醜いんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我会如此丑陋不堪呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n de ko n na ni mi ni ku i n da ro u</span></p><p begin="01:12.625" end="01:16.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">何がいけなかったのか教えてよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我到底是我哪里做错了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ga i ke na ka 't ta no ka o shi e te yo</span></p><p begin="01:16.924" end="01:21.298" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">神様 命をくれよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">神明 请赐予我生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka mi sa ma i no chi wo ku re yo</span></p><p begin="01:30.852" end="01:35.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">なんで生きているんだろうね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟是为什么而活在人世呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n de i ki te i ru n da ro u ne</span></p><p begin="01:35.965" end="01:40.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">喧騒の空間で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在喧嚣的空间里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke n so u no ku u ka n de</span></p><p begin="01:40.978" end="01:45.196" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">顔を蝕むこの傷も嫌いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连侵蚀面容的伤痕都令我厌恶</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka o wo mu shi ba mu ko no ki zu mo ki ra i da</span></p><p begin="01:45.279" end="01:50.584" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">声も出せず堕ちていくだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以发出声音就只能不断地坠落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e mo da se zu o chi te i ku da ke</span></p><p begin="01:50.584" end="01:55.479" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">皆の幸せをもらっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕得到了属于大家的幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na no shi a wa se wo mo ra 't te mo</span></p><p begin="01:55.562" end="02:00.622" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">足りない 全然足りないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依然不够 根本就无法让我满足</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i ze n ze n ta ri na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:00.767" end="02:04.686" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">この心が悪いの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是这颗心坏掉了吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ko ko ro ga wa ru i no ？</span></p><p begin="02:04.686" end="02:09.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">私は見世物じゃないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我并非供人取乐的小丑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha mi se mo no ja na i no</span></p><p begin="02:09.940" end="02:19.508" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">あなたみたいになりたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多希望能成为像你那样的人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta mi ta i ni na ri ta i</span></p><p begin="02:30.827" end="02:35.804" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">強くなれない 正しくなれない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以变得强大 难以正确处事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ku na re na i ta da shi ku na re na i</span></p><p begin="02:35.994" end="02:40.542" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">なんでこんなに醜いんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我会如此丑陋不堪呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n de ko n na ni mi ni ku i n da ro u</span></p><p begin="02:41.068" end="02:45.318" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">何がいけなかったのか教えてよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我到底是我哪里做错了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ga i ke na ka 't ta no ka o shi e te yo</span></p><p begin="02:45.318" end="02:50.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">神様 命をくれよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">神明 请赐予我生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka mi sa ma i no chi wo ku re yo</span></p><p begin="02:50.406" end="02:59.358" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">神様 もう許してくれよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">神明 希望你可以原谅我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka mi sa ma mo u yu ru shi te ku re yo</span></p></div></body></tt>